Float_AppLAb_5Screenshots-2560x1440_02.png", "id": "794174731880069", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974897_794174735213402_5658923504426439013_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3qEe7bzTCjcQ7kNvwFLKreP&_nc_oc=AdpJsMu8xSEXPzAt_p7SvU7SxO2mEZikCjz8Tj9-sypgif7w9ANlcFF53OFDo64vkuM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMiKUoKDo7-lfy0L08Qp_K9PWoT722TWOtDvU99ssn2pw&oe=6AC66A8C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vidthumb.png", "id": "419702353686012", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031447_419702357019345_1078684321555486491_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=moMuKRxNtUIQ7kNvwG7x-ng&_nc_oc=AdoJ5Bwr_Cbw9SmE6_vpZf0KBda-D0JrdKq2BnGk_z2inPwQ_8UeqfqKfLQc8LbX8sU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNux52cjcyW01qTILsSFIAKIoY_GTylXOksD25-h3QrHw&oe=6AC66480"}, "display_name": "FloatVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nDISCOVER rare creatures and interactive objects.\n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need to reset and recharge...\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nWhen you need to just BE...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE FOR YOU.  ", "short_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nWATCH strange creatures doing their thing. \n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twic